From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fogtape <lilixu3210@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: profile ICU data for danmu_api lite runtimes

Keep complete ICU API mode while filtering the lite data payload to the
core's retained locale families and all Node TextDecoder web encodings.
Preserve converter dependencies, Unicode normalization, IDNA, segmentation
and complete timezone coverage. Validate required resources before and after
trimming, and use an independent intermediate package so a host's complete
ICU cannot hide missing data.

The host genrb's StringBaseResource returns its existing char16_t buffer
directly. The bundled public char16ptr header has the compatibility helper
in global scope, so icu::toUCharPtr fails when rebuilding this host tool.
This does not change the linked mobile runtime.
---
 deps/icu-small/source/tools/genrb/reslist.h |   2 +-
 tools/icu/danmu-lite.json                   | 287 ++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/icu/icu-generic.gyp                   |  19 +-
 tools/icu/prepare-mobile-icu.py             |  83 ++++++
 4 files changed, 385 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/icu/danmu-lite.json
 create mode 100755 tools/icu/prepare-mobile-icu.py

